{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>\nTVB節目《美食強人》今晚戰況激烈，一眾專業評審在品評來自澳門的「藍天使蝦金魚餃」時爆發激烈辯論！當食評家西Dorsi提出兩大批評後，竟隨即惹來「Mott32 集團行政總廚」李文星等三位名廚聯手「圍攻」反駁，場面充滿火藥味！究竟西Dorsi說了什麼，引發這場廚藝界大戰？\n</p>\n<h2>西Dorsi質疑金魚餃皮厚味重：唔Sure味道係咪嚟自蝦</h2>\n<p>來自澳門的食店憑著精緻的金魚造型蝦餃吸引食客，雖然滕麗名大讚廚師細心「掹蝦腸」，但西Dorsi卻持相反意見。他直接點出兩大問題，首先是造型影響口感：「因為佢做金魚形狀，令到啲皮集中喺魚頭同魚尾」、「第一啖只會食到啲蝦為主，第二啖就食到啲皮為主。」其次，他質疑調味過重，掩蓋了蝦的鮮味：「我唔 Sure 佢個味道係嚟自蝦嘅本身，定係調味料。」</p>\n<h2>李文星周世韜力撐像身點心 陳世輝公開調味秘方平反</h2>\n<p>西Dorsi的兩點批評一出，立刻引來多位總廚級評審反駁。「Mott32 集團行政總廚」李文星首先解釋：「呢啲我哋叫像身點心，造型經過好多手工喺裏面，有一啲感覺會厚啲，但成個感覺係配合得完美。」「唐述營運及廚藝總監」周世韜亦力撐食店，認為在像身點心領域：「佢都真係做到極致。」至於調味問題，「LUBUDS 飲食集團點心行政總廚」陳世輝則直接為師傅平反，指師傅只用了鹽、雞粉、糖及大地魚粉，並強調：「其實唔多」、「基本上係呢啲嘢嘅啫。」</p>\n<h2>網民熱議造型與味道之爭：食點心究竟食樣定食味</h2>\n<p>節目中的激烈辯論引發網民熱議，大家對「像身點心」應重外形還是味道意見兩極。「西Dorsi講得有道理，幾靚都好，皮厚就係唔得啦。」「我就係為咗個樣去食！打卡都開心啲！」「啲大廚講得啱，像身點心係食手工，唔可以同普通蝦餃比。」「其實兩邊都啱，最好就係又靚又好食！」「好想睇佢哋喺節目度點樣鬧交，實好精彩！」</p>\n<h2>澳門新葡京酒店「8餐廳」</h2>\n<p>地址：澳門葡京路新葡京酒店2樓</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/03_13464841736af5421b918bf.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/03_13464841736af5421b918bf.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/14_11065466276af5424412409.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/14_11065466276af5424412409.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/15_7749638626af5424703ccf.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/15_7749638626af5424703ccf.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/16_11043167176af5424a8b3e9.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/16_11043167176af5424a8b3e9.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17_14900671286af5424e1be62.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17_14900671286af5424e1be62.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/18_13607418146af5425171a85.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/18_13607418146af5425171a85.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T16:03:55.121727+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":1061,"images":6,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T15:39:26+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T23:57:55.710125+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T15:57:25.839215+00:00","content_hash":"282b1d92c7b3665fb78067c513d9761ab2eb41681f3510f03d5f11ef4439bbf1","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}